{"seq":18,"slug":"ai-data-engineering","title":"AI 数据工程","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.58,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-数据工程-简介\">AI 数据工程 简介</h1><p>AI 数据工程是连接原始数据与机器学习模型之间的关键桥梁。在实际的 AI 项目中，数据准备和处理往往占据了整个开发周期的大部分时间，数据质量直接决定了模型效果的上限。本知识库系统梳理 AI 数据工程的全流程方法论与工程实践，帮助开发者构建可靠、高效的数据基础设施。</p>\n<p>本知识库适合有一定编程基础并希望深入 AI 工程化实践的中高级开发者，尤其是数据工程师、机器学习工程师以及全栈 AI 开发者。无论你是在搭建数据管线、优化特征工程，还是建立数据治理体系，都能从中获得系统性的指导。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>数据采集与清洗</strong>讲解从网络爬虫到数据清洗管线的完整流程，涵盖数据去重和流式数据摄入等核心技术，帮助你获取干净、可用的原始数据。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>数据标注与质量</strong>深入探讨标注策略设计、主动学习在标注中的应用、数据质量度量体系以及合成数据生成技术，解决 AI 项目中最耗时的数据标注难题。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>特征工程</strong>系统介绍特征提取、特征选择和特征存储的核心方法，以及自动化特征工程工具的使用，帮助你将原始数据转化为模型可以高效学习的表示。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>数据管线与 MLOps</strong>聚焦 ETL 管线设计、数据版本管理、实验追踪和模型服务管线等工程实践，帮助你建立从数据到部署的自动化工作流。</p>\n<p>第5章<strong>数据治理</strong>涵盖数据隐私保护、数据血缘追踪、偏差检测与合规框架等主题，确保你的 AI 系统在数据层面安全、可追溯、合乎法规。</p>\n<p>建议学习路径：先从第1章和第2章掌握数据获取与质量保障的基础能力，再通过第3章学习特征工程的核心技术，然后进入第4章构建端到端的数据管线。第5章的数据治理贯穿整个流程，可以在实际项目中逐步落地。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-collection-cleaning","title":"数据采集与清洗","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-collection-cleaning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"web-scraping","title":"Web 爬虫与数据采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-collection-cleaning/web-scraping"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-cleaning-pipeline","title":"数据清洗流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-collection-cleaning/data-cleaning-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-deduplication","title":"数据去重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-collection-cleaning/data-deduplication"},{"seq":4,"slug":"streaming-ingestion","title":"流式数据接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-collection-cleaning/streaming-ingestion"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-labeling-quality","title":"数据标注与质量","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-labeling-quality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"labeling-strategies","title":"标注策略与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-labeling-quality/labeling-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"active-learning","title":"主动学习与标注优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-labeling-quality/active-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-quality-metrics","title":"数据质量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-labeling-quality/data-quality-metrics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"synthetic-data","title":"合成数据生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-labeling-quality/synthetic-data"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-engineering","title":"特征工程","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/feature-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-extraction","title":"特征提取方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/feature-engineering/feature-extraction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feature-selection","title":"特征选择与降维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/feature-engineering/feature-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-store","title":"特征存储与复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/feature-engineering/feature-store"},{"seq":4,"slug":"automated-feature-engineering","title":"自动化特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/feature-engineering/automated-feature-engineering"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-pipeline-mlops","title":"数据管线与 MLOps","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-pipeline-mlops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"etl-pipeline-design","title":"ETL 管道设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-pipeline-mlops/etl-pipeline-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-versioning","title":"数据版本控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-pipeline-mlops/data-versioning"},{"seq":3,"slu